"date": 1791849600, "platform": 6, "y": 2026, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 1970776, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc168ns.jpg"}, {"id": 1970778, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc168nu.jpg"}, {"id": 1970780, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc168nw.jpg"}, {"id": 1970775, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc168nr.jpg"}, {"id": 1970779, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc168nv.jpg"}, {"id": 1970782, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc168ny.jpg"}, {"id": 1970781, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc168nx.jpg"}, {"id": 1970774, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc168nq.jpg"}, {"id": 1970772, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc168no.jpg"}, {"id": 1970773, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc168np.jpg"}, {"id": 1970777, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc168nt.jpg"}], "slug": "hungry-horrors", "storyline": "When a ravenous curse takes hold of the kingdom, the monsters of British and Irish legend become Hungry Horrors, and every one of them is heading straight for the Princess. Spoilt and in no mood for adventure, she would far rather stay in bed and leave the problem to someone else. The Horrors, unfortunately, have other ideas.\n\nRather than fight them, the Princess cooks. Serving dishes from real British and Irish recipes, from Boxty and Cullen Skink to Sticky Toffee Pudding, she must keep each Horror fed before it reaches her and feeds on her instead. Redcaps, Knuckers, Banshees and many more each have their own way of finishing her if they get close enough. Along the way she meets figures from the same legends, including Ceridwen and Failinis.", "summary": "Face legendary creatures from British and Irish folklore in this roguelite deck builder where cooking replaces combat. As a princess, you must prepare dishes to feed these monsters or risk becoming their next meal.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/hungry-horrors", "videos": [{"id": 131267, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "jOV7f-G-pic", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jOV7f-G-pic", "title": "Hungry Horrors - Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jOV7f-G-pic/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 131268, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "IXAxVYFUPyI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IXAxVYFUPyI", "title": "Hungry Horrors - Official Reveal Trailer | The Indie Horror Showcase 2024", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IXAxVYFUPyI/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 144777, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "ZkDSWMvGif8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZkDSWMvGif8", "title": "Hungry Horrors | Demo Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ZkDSWMvGif8/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 155133, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "pHAZS4HMzyg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pHAZS4HMzyg", "title": "Hungry Horrors Trailer IndieMania 2025", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/pHAZS4HMzyg/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 171776, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "s0D9rhAFbBE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s0D9rhAFbBE", "title": "Hungry Horrors - Early Access Release Date Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/s0D9rhAFbBE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 174909, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "w14rGjLoEAQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w14rGjLoEAQ", "title": "Hungry Horrors - Early Access Launch Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/w14rGjLoEAQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 199628, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "GNSwc7O7AFI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GNSwc7O7AFI", "title": "Hungry Horrors - Full Release Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/GNSwc7O7AFI/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "game_localizations": [{"id": 62843, "name": "\ud5dd\uadf8\ub9ac \ud638\ub7ec\uc988", "cover": {"id": 612629, "url": "//images.igd